{"ID":"20240118145015-gvgn7lc","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118145015-gvgn7lc","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118145015-gvgn7lc\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118145015-33hhanv\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122161709-r2yfueq\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:91,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122161709-r2yfueq\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:87,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:87\u0026#125;","title":"318郁李仁","type":"doc","updated":"20240204144412"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118145015-33hhanv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118145015-33hhanv","updated":"20240122161620"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味酸，平，无毒。治大腹水肿，面目四肢浮肿，利小便水道，根，治齿断肿，龋齿，坚齿。生高山川谷及丘陵。一名爵李。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122161624-qmifzdn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161624-qmifzdn"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】产我国陕西甘肃等地，他处亦多有之，其树虽似李树，而结子小若樱桃，核仁入药。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122161626-g4cuz4o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161626-g4cuz4o"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味酸（或作苦辛），性平，无毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122161628-8enicnh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161628-8enicnh"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】郁李仁为润燥破血，泄气行水要药，主大肠气滞，关格不通，治大腹水肿，四肢浮肿，破结气，利水道。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122161630-sf9gu8e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161630-sf9gu8e"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【孟铣】破癖气，下四肢水，酒服四十九粒，能泻结气。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122161631-wmgkr15","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161631-wmgkr15"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【甄权】阳中结气，关格不通。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122161633-egw68d2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161633-egw68d2"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【大明】泄五脏膀胱急痛，宣腰胯冷脓，消宿食下气。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122161634-ubztxys","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161634-ubztxys"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【元素】破血润燥。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122161639-sfgfbxy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161639-sfgfbxy"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【东垣】专治大肠气滞，燥湿不通。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122161640-5ec2lju","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161640-5ec2lju"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【宗奭】研和龙脑点赤眼。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122161642-cc777j3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161642-cc777j3"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通一钱至三钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122161643-6nph1gs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161643-6nph1gs"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】性专下降，善导大肠燥结，利周身水气，然下后多令人津液亏损，燥结愈甚，乃治标救急之药，非可常用，津液不足者忌用之。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122161644-xfrxenu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161644-xfrxenu"}},{"ID":"20240122161644-qyuxj5s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161644-qyuxj5s"}},{"ID":"20240122161644-szbfck7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161644-szbfck7","updated":"20240204144052"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"诸位看这个318郁李仁，味酸，性平，是没有毒的药，诸位看，本草经的原文呢它专治，治疗大腹水肿、面目四肢浮肿，利小便水道。"}]},{"ID":"20240122161649-v0yhxut","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161649-v0yhxut","updated":"20240122161652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"郁李，那个李树的根呢，治牙齿断掉，肿起来，牙龈肿都可以。性味味酸，性平，味道是酸味的，主收敛。郁李仁呢，是润燥破血，泄气行水的药。"}]},{"ID":"20240122161655-s6z5du8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161655-s6z5du8","updated":"20240122161657"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"有时你的气，没办法堵在里面，气机不通，这个时候我们用郁李仁把气泄掉，把水排出来，处方的时候你用3钱、5钱都可以，那这个产地呢，你看，陕西、甘肃，它树看上去像李树，但结子小，像樱桃一样，核仁入药，你们看到的是仁和核。"}]},{"ID":"20240122161700-h5bk8cc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161700-h5bk8cc","updated":"20240204144315"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那【孟铣】呢它直接生用，这个破癖气下四肢水，久服四十九粒，能够泄结气，郁李仁本来一颗一颗的，它说四十九，那真的你也不用去算四十九哦，因为过去很多的医家呢，都以四十九为一个数，为什么？因为七七是四十九，是阳数，所以它用四十九，因为它能够行阳嘛，能够散气，真的说四十八或五十无所谓啊，我不相信会差了一点点。"}]},{"ID":"20240122161709-r2yfueq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161709-r2yfueq","updated":"20240204144412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个主要呢，就是气结在腹中。郁李仁本身没有毒，所以你用大剂也没有关系。你看它这个禁忌，郁李仁，性专下降，非常善于导大肠的燥结，利周身的水气，但是你"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"用多了的话，让病人有脱水的现象"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以使用上面呢要注意一下。一般来说，我们救急的药的时候，在有时机的时候，病人还没元气大虚的时候，我们峻下，大下没有关系。"}]}]}